\include scripts/macros.script

{\font noto 14 bold \centerline{ETERNAL LIFE}}
\vskip 10

Have you ever received a gift that changed your life? God offers one to you right now.

\vskip 10
{\font noto 12 bold \centerline{THE PROBLEM}}
\vskip 5

We've all fallen short of God's perfect standard. Our wrong choices separate us from a holy God, leading to emptiness and eternal separation.

\vskip 10
{\font noto 12 bold \centerline{THE GIFT}}
\vskip 5

{\italic{"For God so loved the world that He gave His only Son, that whoever believes in Him should not perish but have eternal life." (John 3:16)}}

God offers salvation as a free gift through Jesus, who paid the price for our sins by dying on the cross and rising again.

\vskip 10
{\font noto 12 bold \centerline{TRUE REPENTANCE}}
\vskip 5

Receiving this gift means turning away from sin. {\italic{"Repent therefore, and turn back, that your sins may be blotted out." (Acts 3:19)}}

Real faith involves a complete change of heart—choosing God's way instead of our own.

\vskip 10
{\font noto 12 bold \centerline{YOUR RESPONSE}}
\vskip 5

This gift must be received. {\italic{"If you confess with your mouth that Jesus is Lord and believe in your heart that God raised Him from the dead, you will be saved." (Romans 10:9)}}

Will you accept God's perfect gift today?

\vskip 10
{\font noto 14 bold \centerline{Pray:}} "God, I admit I've sinned and turn away from that life. Thank you for your gift of Jesus. I believe He died for me and rose again. I receive your gift of forgiveness and commit to following you. Amen."

\centerline{[contact information]}

